  "_note": "TMS9918A Video Display Processor. Pin table audited against TI TMS9918A datasheet (SPPS017). DIP-40 package. CPU data bus D0-D7 (pins 15-8), control: MODE (pin 17), /CSR (pin 18, read), /CSW (pin 19, write), R/W (pin 16), /INT (pin 5). VRAM interface (decorative — machine owns VRAM): AD0-AD7 (pins 23-30, multiplexed address), RD0-RD7 (pins 31-38, data), RAS/CAS (pins 21-22). CPUCLK (pin 4), GROMCLK (pin 6), COMVID (pin 7, composite video output). GND=pin 20, VDD=pin 39. Pin 1=NC (TMS9918A; was VBB on TMS9918). Pin 40=NC (TMS9918A; was VCC +12V on TMS9918).",
